{"id":"f565d10686cf040a","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-weak-chain-condition.md","title":"Weak Chain Condition","display":"df-weak-chain-condition — Weak Chain Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-weak-chain-condition","aliases":["58-df-weak-chain-condition"],"display":"df-weak-chain-condition — Weak Chain Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-weak-chain-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-weak-chain-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weak-chain-condition — Weak Chain Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"547a2141e41387ca\" href=\"?note=547a2141e41387ca\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md\">../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md\">../batch11/58-df-antichain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\)</span> (set-coded poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CCC}\">\\(\\operatorname{CCC}\\)</span> (countable chain condition predicate, 本文件定义)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (poset predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (antichain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md\">../batch11/58-df-antichain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Countable}_S(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Countable}_S(A)\\)</span> (countability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\operatorname{CCC}(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\leq_P\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\to\\operatorname{Countable}_S(A))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\operatorname{CCC}(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\leq_P\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\to\\operatorname{Countable}_S(A))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Countable chain condition” means precisely that every antichain is countable; a separate c.c.a. condition is not being defined here.</li>\n<li>Forcing with a c.c.c. poset preserves cardinals and cofinalities.</li>\n<li>Cohen forcing and random forcing are c.c.c.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>-c.c. means every antichain has size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\omega_1\">\\(&lt;\\omega_1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md","status":"resolved","id":"547a2141e41387ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)$ (antichain predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Countable}_S(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\operatorname{CCC}(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\leq_P\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\to\\operatorname{Countable}_S(A))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"<\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":1417,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1375","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-weak-chain-condition.md|58-df-weak-chain-condition]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["547a2141e41387ca","b98049bc73009c64","d3f859dbdd37f018","1b3610e6aed65b25"]}